{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174170/extras/57d68f10ba79eb30dc22dd12092701f8.avif?t=1645033996\" width=618 height=171 /></span><br>Earthshine tells the story of two travelers, Talia and Inar, as they journey across the Desert in search of the Fields of Oblivion. Legend has it that these fields contain beautiful flowers: flowers that can heal any wounds, resurrect the dead, and grant immortality to those who seek it. But nobody has ever proved the rumors to be true before\u2026<br><br>Who are Talia and Inar? Are they just two strangers, or something more? Will they make it to the Fields of Oblivion, and find the answers they've been searching for?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174170/extras/05bda47289acb666c2c1cfd5473e1038.avif?t=1645033996\" width=617 height=171 /></span><br>- Approximately 1-2 hours of gameplay;<br>- Non-linear plot;<br>- Unique visual style, not typical for visual novels;<br>- Female protagonist;<br>- Magical setting which features legends from multiple nations<br>- Themes of love, fate, and difficult choice<br>- The novel will appeal to fairy tale fans of all genders<br><br>Whatever you choose, choose from the bottom of your heart!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174170/extras/dd3f070de1b6ec1fcf0110d241f96683.avif?t=1645033996\" width=620 height=147 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"3c89b42b3ccb17bd89052eaab6f4368b880b4fa9.jpg","localized_name":"Opened the gallery","name":"Opened the gallery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1174170/3c89b42b3ccb17bd89052eaab6f4368b880b4fa9.jpg"},{"icon":"ac429f805b1d63f268842bee8fa3f497c416177d.jpg","localized_name":"Fire and wind","name":"Fire and wind